  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 49082433536
    m_Localized: WASD Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822144
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822145
    m_Localized: Walk with W, A, S and D.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822146
    m_Localized: Look around with the mouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822147
    m_Localized: Looking Around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822148
    m_Localized: Move the mouse to look around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822149
    m_Localized: Shift Sprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822150
    m_Localized: Sprinting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822151
    m_Localized: Hold Shift while walking to sprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822152
    m_Localized: Interaction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822153
    m_Localized: Aim at something nearby to see its key and name. Press F to use
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655830337355776
    m_Localized: Drawing Spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655830354132992
    m_Localized: On the Spell Practice tab of your codex, hold F to start. While
      holding, left-click to draw lines; release F to judge. Space judges right away;
      right-click or Esc cancels (right-click costs recovery time).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894722
    m_Localized: Press M for the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894723
    m_Localized: Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894724
    m_Localized: Walk to reveal the forest map. Revealed areas stay revealed. The
      minimap at the top right shows your surroundings; press M to see the whole
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611895144448
    m_Localized: Combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727360
    m_Localized: "Hold F to draw \u2192 release F to judge \u2192 aim for 3 seconds
      \u2192 fire. A wrong drawing fails and costs health, mana, and stamina. Canceling
      with right-click makes you recover for one second per rune. Fire and Water
      runes can be thrown on their own. Companions fight on their own and die if
      they fall. If you fall, you drop your gold and wake up at the inn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727361
    m_Localized: Enemies are coming. Hold F to start casting; a parchment appears
      in the middle of the screen. While you hold F, hold the left mouse button and
      move the mouse to draw a spell on the parchment. You can draw in several strokes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727362
    m_Localized: Release F to judge your drawing. It must match a drawing in your
      Codex. A wrong drawing makes the magic fail, and you lose health, mana, and
      stamina. Tapping F for less than 0.35 seconds interacts instead of casting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727363
    m_Localized: 'Right-click while drawing to cancel. If your drawing is a magic,
      you can do nothing while you recover for one second per rune: 1 second for
      a rune spell, 2 seconds for a 2-rune magic. A drawing that isn''t a magic is
      canceled right away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727364
    m_Localized: If it matches, aim with your mouse for 3 seconds. Left-click to
      fire, or it fires on its own when time runs out. You can't move while aiming.
      Right-clicking while aiming makes you recover too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727365
    m_Localized: Runes that create something, like Fire and Water, can be thrown
      on their own. Condense, Line and Block do nothing alone. Multi-rune magic is
      stronger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1321611907727366
    m_Localized: Your companions follow and fight on their own. A fallen companion
      dies. If you fall, you drop your gold where you fell and wake up at the inn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
